1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:03,768
Since August 2026 the law wants generated content marked.

2
00:00:03,768 --> 00:00:10,858
Studios ship dozens of generated assets a week; the reviewer
checks by hand, and nobody can prove which one was checked.

3
00:00:11,258 --> 00:00:15,665
Airlock: four gates, then a verdict that asks Grafana before
it rules.

4
00:00:15,665 --> 00:00:20,450
The rights gate is amber: its telemetry has been dark for
seventeen minutes.

5
00:00:20,450 --> 00:00:21,331
Remember that.

6
00:00:21,731 --> 00:00:24,408
A real commercial with a real trademark on screen.

7
00:00:24,408 --> 00:00:28,584
The four gates run in parallel on Vertex AI Agent Engine
while the clip plays.

8
00:00:28,984 --> 00:00:34,949
Provenance is a cryptographic check, not an opinion: this
film was shot decades before C2PA existed.

9
00:00:37,849 --> 00:00:43,377
Brand: the charter forbids health claims, comparisons and
children, and the wordmark is not even there.

10
00:00:49,726 --> 00:00:51,822
Click the time and the clip goes there.

11
00:00:51,822 --> 00:00:55,907
The claim gate reads every claim with its timestamp and maps
it to the rule:

12
00:00:55,907 --> 00:01:00,100
an expert endorsement, an organisation endorsement, no
substantiation on file.

13
00:01:00,500 --> 00:01:05,928
Rights: the Video Intelligence API found the logo and the
faces; the registry clears neither.

14
00:01:06,328 --> 00:01:12,668
Before it rules, the verdict asks Grafana about each gate:
healthy, and has it caught a real injected defect this week.

15
00:01:12,668 --> 00:01:17,144
Then it writes the verdict back as an annotation and opens
the incident for a human.

16
00:01:17,544 --> 00:01:19,145
There it is, on the dashboard.

17
00:01:23,768 --> 00:01:26,818
A clean generated asset, signed with a real manifest.

18
00:01:27,564 --> 00:01:33,363
Provenance passes in under a second: the manifest verifies
against the studio's own trust list.

19
00:01:33,363 --> 00:01:34,767
Brand and claim follow.

20
00:01:40,430 --> 00:01:41,605
Four gates pass.

21
00:01:42,105 --> 00:01:43,863
And the verdict still refuses:

22
00:01:43,863 --> 00:01:48,200
Grafana cannot see the rights control succeed, so its PASS
does not count.

23
00:01:48,200 --> 00:01:50,661
A control nobody can see is not a control.

24
00:01:51,061 --> 00:01:53,205
Turn the telemetry back on and run again.

25
00:01:53,605 --> 00:01:55,189
Same clip, same gates.

26
00:02:01,381 --> 00:02:02,854
Brand and claim pass again.

27
00:02:02,854 --> 00:02:07,490
The rights gate reads the clip one more time, and this time
its push reaches Grafana.

28
00:02:07,954 --> 00:02:11,936
Now every gate is healthy and has caught a real injected
defect this week.

29
00:02:11,936 --> 00:02:14,842
This is the PASS the reviewer no longer signs by hand.

30
00:02:15,242 --> 00:02:17,745
Every verdict is an annotation on this dashboard.

31
00:02:17,745 --> 00:02:20,094
Every block that needs a human is an incident.

32
00:02:20,094 --> 00:02:24,282
Each gate had to catch a real injected defect before it
earned the right to block.

33
00:02:24,682 --> 00:02:28,327
Nothing ships without a gate that has already caught a real
defect.

34
00:02:28,327 --> 00:02:29,198
That is Airlock.
